out software or technology solutions used to manage...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Which best describes your role in decisions about software or technology solutions used to manage workflows or operations at your organization? <br><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><em>Please select one answer.<\/em><\/span>","DataExportTag":"Q9","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Which best describes your role in decisions about software or technology solutions used to manage...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I lead or have final decision-making authority"},"2":{"Display":"I am directly involved in evaluating and selecting solutions"},"3":{"Display":"I provide input or recommendations, but do not make the final decision"},"4":{"Display":"I am aware of how decisions are made, but am not directly involved"},"5":{"Display":"I have limited or no visibility into how these decisions are made"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,3,4,5],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID11"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_50jLxpALQBHVxCm","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID12","SecondaryAttribute":"How familiar are you, personally, with AI tools as defined below? AI Tools Definition: AI tools a...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"How familiar are you, personally, with AI tools as defined below?<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<strong>AI Tools Definition:<\/strong> <em>AI tools are software applications that use artificial intelligence to help perform tasks such as analyzing information, generating content, making recommendations, or automating workflows. Examples include chatbots, virtual assistants, and AI-powered business tools.<\/em><br \/>\n<span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><em>Please select one answer.<\/em><\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q10","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"How familiar are you, personally, with AI tools as defined below? AI Tools Definition: AI tools a...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Deeply familiar"},"2":{"Display":"Moderately familiar"},"3":{"Display":"Generally aware, but limited operational familiarity"},"4":{"Display":"Limited awareness"},"5":{"Display":"Not at all aware, never heard of it"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,3,4,5],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID12"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_50jLxpALQBHVxCm","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID13","SecondaryAttribute":"Which best describes your organization\u2019s current stage of adoption for agentic AI in operational..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Which best describes your organization&rsquo;s current stage of adoption for agentic AI in operational workflows?<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<strong>Agentic AI Definition:<\/strong> <em>For this survey, agentic AI refers to software-based AI agents that can complete multi-step operational tasks with some degree of autonomy. These agents can analyze information, make recommendations or decisions, trigger actions, and coordinate across systems or people. This goes beyond chatbots, dashboards, simple workflow automation, or fixed-rule scripts.<\/em><br \/>\n<span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><em>Please select one answer.<\/em><\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q11","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Which best describes your organization\u2019s current stage of adoption for agentic AI in operational...","Choices":{"1":{"Display